"Some profiles have unnecessary key mappings which may interfere with window tiling shortcuts added in macOS Sequoia. These were in the default profile for many years but are no longer needed. Remove the key mappings? It shouldn’t break anything, and it won’t modify the on-disk copy of the dynamic profile." = "一些設定檔有不必要的按鍵對應，可能會干擾 macOS Sequoia 中新增的視窗並排捷徑。這些對應在預設設定檔中存在多年，但已不再需要。是否移除這些按鍵對應？這不會破壞任何功能，也不會修改動態設定檔的磁碟副本。";
